      <description>&lt;p&gt;We are a &lt;strong&gt;small, family-run hotel&lt;/strong&gt; built with care, run with love, and maintained with pride.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sapumal Lodge&lt;/strong&gt; is not just a business — it’s the house we grew up in. Every wall, every room holds memories, and we’ve transformed this beloved family home into a peaceful haven for guests from all over the world.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We are passionate about providing a &lt;strong&gt;friendly, family-oriented service&lt;/strong&gt;. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re visiting Anuradhapura for its sacred history or a quiet getaway, we want you to feel truly at home.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
